---
description: Twig templates and public bundle assets
globs:
  - "templates/**/*.twig"
  - "src/**/Resources/views/**/*.twig"
  - "src/Resources/public/**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---

Prefer:
- small, backward-compatible template and public asset changes
- preserving current block structure
- local DOM updates
- reusing existing classes, ids, and hooks
- minimal asset changes

Do not hand-edit anything under `src/Resources/public/` (`milkdown-editor.js`, `milkdown-editor.css`, `chunks/`, `katex/`): it is generated by `make assets` from `src/Resources/assets/src/`.
Never write raw `<form>`, `<input>`, `<textarea>` or `<select>` in Twig (REQ-TWIG-005); no inline `<script>` / `style` attributes (strict CSP).
Do not rewrite entire templates or public asset trees for a local change.
